hed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="kill" lane="tools" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-WB-DESKTOP-SERVER-UNTRUSTED / W11"><mxGeometry x="2982.667" y="524.627" width="348" height="190.666" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-10" value="RPC ok ACK仅处理函数返回&#xa;可无操作、信号失败也非退出证明&#xa;list消失仅Map登记状态&#xa;[ART-WB-DESKTOP-SERVER-UNTRUS&#xa;TED / W11]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="ack-kill" lane="state" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-WB-DESKTOP-SERVER-UNTRUSTED / W11"><mxGeometry x="3730.667" y="525.293" width="348" height="144" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-11" value="spawn后best-effort写账&#xa;cleanup不删账，onExit才清&#xa;写入失败/缺账不保证后续reap&#xa;[ART-WB-DESKTOP-SERVER-UNTRUS&#xa;TED / W11]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="journal" lane="control" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-WB-DESKTOP-SERVER-UNTRUSTED / W11"><mxGeometry x="740" y="731.96" width="348" height="144" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-12" value="受管PID退出未实测&#xa;完整进程树/脱组工具终态未知&#xa;外部effects与云恢复未知&#xa;[W11]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#8b9098;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="unknown" lane="external" laneAuthority="analys